				<r3d:description language="eng">IAGOS aims to provide long-term, regular and spatially resolved in situ observations of the atmospheric composition. The observation systems are deployed on a fleet of 10 to 15 commercial aircraft measuring atmospheric chemistry concentrations and meteorological fields.
The IAGOS Data Centre manages and gives access to all the data produced within the project.</r3d:description>
